# NPC aggro link groups (aggro_links / npc_aggro_links), data-inferred rule AGGROLINK-1.
#
# main_world places two members of group 66 at the same spot: NPC 508 "wandering tree
# spirit" and NPC 7624 "tree giant" (9966.957, 15162.164, 234.23795). Both templates are
# non-aggressive with `aggro_link_special_rule_id` 0, so neither helps the other through the
# template rules (`UpdateAggroHelp` needs `aggression` for rule 0). With the link group, the
# other member must join the fight when one is attacked.
#
# Run the game log with `aaemu_game::systems::ai=debug` so the join is visible. GM access is
# needed for the `/move` teleport.
suite aggro-links
bot linker gm

[linker]
tp 9963 15162 234
pump 4
units 508 7624
castraw 2 508
expectlog "aggro link: group member joined the fight" 20
pump 4
